      "role": "user",
      "content": "hi, my knee is killing me today. the osteoarthritis is acting up really bad and it's hard to even walk. i know i'm supposed to be careful cuz i take eliquis for my afib, but can i just take some ibuprofen for the swelling? how much is safe to take so i don't mess up my blood thinner?",
